<title>POLAND: PPABank Q2 net rises to PLN 3,1 mln.</title>
<headline>PPABank Q2 net rises to PLN 3,1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPABank SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations    15.59    vs   9.99</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 5.27    vs   3.60</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.14    vs   1.87</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Pierwszy Polsko- Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   19.94    vs  12.40</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 9.88    vs   6.42</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   4.18    vs   2.96</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.34    vs   0.32</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.13    vs   1.72</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>					    H1 1997	 H2 1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations    28.11    vs   18.62</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			10.07    vs    5.99</p>
<p>    net profit			     6.15    vs    3.23</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs    0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   36.95    vs   24.03</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	18.23    vs   12.42</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   7.47    vs    5.43</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.60    vs    0.52</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.92    vs    2.76</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs    0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00    vs    0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
